<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:30:54.167+01:00" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET CONFIRM 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET CONFIRM command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET CONFIRM 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">指定当全屏输入中的字段被完全填满时，用户是否必须按 Enter 键才能离开该字段。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET CONFIRM ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab/>ON 要求用户按 Enter 键才能离开该字段。OFF 会自动将光标移到下一个字段。该值也可以是一个宏（&amp;），其求值结果为 ON 或 OFF。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该设置存储在运行时状态中，但运行时目前不使用它。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_BELL">SET BELL</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_ESCAPE">SET ESCAPE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_CURSOR">SET CURSOR</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
